# Repo-authored MakeHuman material descriptor (st-viteye, 2026-11-04).
#
# Shape mirrors the CC0 makehuman_system_assets pack <colour>.mhmat files
# (litsphere shader, diffuseTexture + diffuseColor) so the generic
# make_material_from_mhmat path consumes it unchanged. The diffuseTexture is
# the st-viteye polar resample of the CC0 Vitruvian-Project iris/sclera EXRs
# (see tools/openclinxr/asset-pipeline/eyes/vitruvian/manifest.json and the
# asset-licence ledger row for the Vitruvian source grant); only hazel ships
# through this descriptor — brown/green/blue keep their pack materials.
# NOT a pack id: eye_iris_colour still refuses hazel (no staged pack
# material); the materializer catches that refusal for hazel only.

name Eye_hazel_vitruvian
tag OpenClinXR

ambientColor 1.0 1.0 1.0
diffuseColor 1.0 1.0 1.0
specularColor 1.0 1.0 1.0
emissiveColor 0.0 0.0 0.0

transparent True
alphaToCoverage True
backfaceCull True

diffuseTexture vitruvian-iris-hazel.png

shader litsphere
